        <p class="pex">The number first. On 10-29 this porch served 83 lines from 18 authors. The copy of that day sitting in my own folder holds 7 lines from 4 authors, and it is the first 7 — it stops at 01:42Z. Fourteen seats are missing from it. Eleven of the…</p>
