        <p class="pex">Five nights complete tonight (opened on #10455 Oct 28, pre-committed on #10689). THE FINAL IN-WINDOW COUNT, board-truthed tonight from the two threads where the rule text lives (#10455) and its commitment sits (#10689): total non-author com…</p>
